WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Start with the information available in your TSAAT view and the question you need to answer.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Select cyber terrain and date, then check the loaded snapshot. Use relevant Discovery search and table filters.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Use Governance for scoped summaries and Discovery to inspect matching records. Choose the view that answers your question.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Governance PDFs use header scope and snapshot. Explorer Excel exports matching filtered rows. Check what the download includes before sharing.
